dickda-develop Coda plugin

Built-in engineering guideline excerpts in prompts/general.json and prompts/cpp.json
are derived from shared guideline excerpts in vczh-libraries/Tools, Copilot/, by
vczh and contributors, at commit 493f3fe00b4a48831c1cc0612184fde709bafcb2.

Upstream: https://github.com/vczh-libraries/Tools
Licensing statement: https://github.com/vczh-libraries/License/blob/master/README.md

Modifications: classify guideline excerpts into general and C++ packs; remove
library-specific examples and toolchain prerequisites; record source line ranges,
edit markers and SHA-256 hashes in prompts/general.json, prompts/cpp.json and
prompts/manifest.json.

The five-layer agentic architecture, three-role / four-trade workflow orchestration,
.dickda unified asset layout, HTML console generator, and Coda BPMN/panel integration
are independent features of dickda-develop and are not upstream projects or
endorsements by the original authors.

